<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Douglass returns after finishing six hand-therapy sessions. He does the exercises once or twice a day and uses the diclofenac gel before long writing sessions, usually once or twice a day. He can now write for an hour with pain of about 2 of 10, and he dictates long drafts. He had both sleep sessions with Dr. Morrison. He gets up at the same time each day, stops writing an hour before bed, and now sleeps six and a half to seven hours on most nights; his sleep diary shows two nightmares in the past month, after which he used his routine and went back to sleep. He has no new concerns and agreed to today&apos;s questionnaires and examination. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hand</td><td>Six hand-therapy sessions completed; pain 2 of 10 after an hour of writing; FIHOA 5 of 30</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>Six and a half to seven hours on most nights; two nightmares in the past month</td></tr><tr><td>Scores</td><td>PCL-5 19; PHQ-9 3</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

